{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I'm using latest master with Rails 3.2.19 and got this exception when trying to access /new action for nested resource. \n\n```\nActiveAdmin.register IssueType do\n  belongs_to :issue\nend\n```\n\nHere is beginning of stack trace:\n\n```\nactiverecord (3.2.19) lib/active_record/associations/collection_proxy.rb:91:in `method_missing'\n() .../bundler/gems/active_admin-2ae0a9e09bf9/lib/active_admin/resource_controller/data_access.rb:134:in `build_new_resource'\n() .../bundler/gems/active_admin-2ae0a9e09bf9/lib/active_admin/resource_controller/data_access.rb:120:in `build_resource'\n```\n\nThe problem to my think in #build_new_resource method. It uses #public_send on collection proxy to call [#build](http://apidock.com/rails/ActiveRecord/Associations/CollectionProxy/build) method, which was introduced in rails 4.0. It was before, but triggered somehow tricky with method_missing.\nHere is example in rails 3.2.19 console:\n\n```\nIssue.first.issue_types.send(:build) \n=> #<IssueType id: nil...\nIssue.first.issue_types.public_send(:build)\nNoMethodError: undefined method `build' for #<Array:0x007fe21f0f89b8>\n```\n\nReplacing #public_send to #send could fix this.\nCan it be fixed or AA won't support Rails 3.2.x anymore?\n","closed_by":{"login":"seanlinsley","id":688886,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODg4Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/688886?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanlinsley","html_url":"https://github.com/seanlinsley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanlinsley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanlinsley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanlinsley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanlinsley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanlinsley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanlinsley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanlinsley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanlinsley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seanlinsley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/activeadmin/activeadmin/issues/3262/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/activeadmin/activeadmin/issues/3262/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}